  "design": {
    "decision": "Overtake with side-suit honors instead of ruffing, and save [♠]s for defense, so it pays for winning tricks in suits.",
    "opponent": "Shown on the first side-suit win; opponents ruff your team's side honors whenever they can.",
    "rationale": "This is the broad rare points piece the Suits, Ranks and Rainbow side-suit builds share, at about +135 on a typical round of 4.5 side wins, and it sits against Spades payoffs, so it creates tension between ruffing and cashing. Points are lost on a set, which keeps bids tense.",
